      "purpose": "A fully-free ILE RPG CGI program (CONSUW001) for a card administration system (Sistema de Administracion de Tarjeta). It acts as a web API backend, receiving JSON input via a program interface, parsing it with the YAJL library, and returning JSON or HTML fragments to a web client via QtmhWrStout (IBM HTTP Server CGI write). It supports multiple operations: customer lookup by ID/name/card number, card listing per client, card detail inquiry, balance inquiry, and overdue balance queries. It reads multiple keyed physical files (SATMCLI00/02/03, SATMTAR00/01, SATMTARW1, SATMSAL00/08, SAUMCTA00, SATFLOT04), calls external programs (SATIDES01, SATC0004, QDCXLATE), and builds HTML/JSON response strings inline.",
